+				// they account for all of it. The sprite COUNT per frame is as
+				// useful as the time, because it says whether the cost is a
+				// slow routine or simply a lot of sprites.
+				fprintf(f, "----- konami mixer split: sprites %.2f ms "
+					"(%u calls, %.1f per drawn frame), tilemaps %.2f ms "
+					"(%u calls) -----\n",
